    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlWaitingBody">请按以下顺序完成 iPhone 与 Windows 的系统配对。若 Windows 已连接过此 HID 设备，请先在蓝牙设置中断开，再重新启用控制并重新连接。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlWaitingTargetFormat">设备列表中通常显示为：{0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlWaitingDetail">连接后会弹出蓝牙客户端绑定窗口，请选择对应手机。绑定完成前不会发送输入；等待期间鼠标不会被隐藏或限制。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlPairStepOneFormat">iPhone：打开“设置 → 辅助功能 → 触控 → 辅助触控”，开启“辅助触控”。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlPairStepTwo">iPhone：打开“设置 → 蓝牙”，连接“{0}”，然后点击“配对”。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlPairStepThree">Windows：右下角出现“添加设备 - 点击以设置 iPhone”时，点击该系统通知。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlPairStepFour">Windows：在系统蓝牙配对窗口中点击“配对”。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="BluetoothControlPairStepFive">iPhone：若再次出现配对提示窗口，点击“配对”。</system:String>
